WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
And it's a world that we'll be much happier with.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.080
A dramatically better future is within our reach.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.440
But to get there, we must reject the failed approaches

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:14.560
of the past and work together to confront

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.520
some of the greatest threats in history.

